                    "value": 1
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The risen ydrei has a creature @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Grabbed] or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Restrained]</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The risen ydrei makes a fangs Strike against the grabbed creature. If the Strike hits and inflicts damage, the creature is exposed to necrotic venom.</p>"
